  "title": "Mawson Infrastructure Group Inc. Expands into AI and HPC Markets and Announces the Signing of AI/HPC Colocation Agreement for 20 MW",
  "summary": "Mawson Infrastructure Group Inc. (NASDAQ: MIGI) (\"Mawson\" or “the Company\"), a publicly traded digital infrastructure provider in the United States, today announced that it has entered into a binding AI/HPC (Artificial Intelligence/High-Performance Computing) colocation business agreement (the “Agreement”) with BE Global Development Limited (\"customer\" or \"BE\") to provide an initial 20 megawatts (MW) of digital infrastructure for AI/HPC colocation services at a fixed, pre-determined price for the first two years of the Agreement, and with an initial six-year contract term.",
